	   <h2>Official description</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            Fireworks TV - Adults need time to heal their tired and wounded hearts.<br><br>It is the best personal live broadcasting platform for free viewing in real time like Afreeca TV and Panda TV as a 19-gold adult broadcasting popcorn TV simultaneous transmission interlocking TV.<br>The heart-thumping, expressive reaction of the hot and breathtaking male and female cams that could not be seen in existing personal broadcasts! Fireworks TV life where the weary heart is comforted first!<br><br>- 24 hours real-time broadcasting and subscription is also free! Watching is also free!<br>- Live broadcasting that can be viewed anytime, anywhere without space restrictions with PC or mobile applications!<br>- Live communication with sexy popular female cams and attractive BJs!<br>- SimT with a wide variety of contents such as Mukbang, Gambang, Gambang, Yabang (outdoor broadcasting), Communication Room, etc.<br>- The best healing communication hot-blooded fanbang Kazua!<br><br>★ Information on popcorn items available on Fireworks TV<br><br>- Doosan Popcorn: Automatic gift with a set time difference according to the start and end settings<br>- Consecutive popcorn: Automatic gift with a set time difference according to the number and frequency settings<br>- Luxury Popcorn: The corresponding popcorn can be charged with cash/items and presented to the broadcaster (MC) who conducts the broadcast. Depending on the type, different flash effects are exposed.<br>Type - Gold Rose / Perfume / Shoes / Luxury Handbags / Gold Bars / Diamond Rings / Sports Cars / Yachts / Penthouses, etc.<br><br>- Event Popcorn: The corresponding popcorn can be charged with cash/items and presented to the broadcaster (MC) who conducts the broadcast. Depending on the type, different flash effects are exposed.<br>Type - Caramel Popcorn / Sweet Popcorn / Onion Popcorn, etc.<br><br>★ Information on items available on Fireworks TV<br><br>Full room admission ticket - An item that allows you to watch a broadcast with an excess number of viewers<br>List-up - An item that is always located at the top of the list of broadcasts so that all members can see my broadcast first.<br>Broadcast Entry Effect - Items entered with a special effect when entering the broadcast<br>Other items include premium nickname, manager addition, and list decoration.<br><br>★ Terminology used in Fireworks TV<br><br>Biscuit - The name of people who enjoy broadcasting without buying popcorn<br>Aficionados - Fans who support BJ with a lot of popcorn<br>Chairman - The person at the top of the BJ room is the one who is the most passionate fan!<br>Big Hand - The one who has a chair in several BJ rooms is Big Hand!<br>Annihilation War - A name for a fierce fight to get one out of the room by shooting a gang-toe-con.<br><br>- Fireworks TV boasts the representative VIP service of Yeondong TV.<br>Real-time BJ Ranking Hot Legend Various Fireworks TV Broadcast Special Live Broadcast-<br>fireworks tv<br>Go to ▶https://sparktv.co.kr/<br><br><br>▷Fireworks TV application access right guide<br>[Required access rights]<br># Permission to save: Permission to upload pictures or photos, or to save data registered in the server<br># Phone permission: Permission to change the audio status when an incoming call is received while watching a broadcast<br>(Check terminal status)<br><br>[Optional access rights]<br># SMS Permission: Permission to automatically enter the received SMS verification code<br># Camera access rights: Permissions for camera shooting when broadcasting<br># Microphone access permission: Permission to use audio when broadcasting<br># PIP mode (pop-up mode): Permission to use pop-up mode when watching broadcasts<br># Notification function: Permission to notify favorite broadcasts and announcements<br><br>[How to withdraw access rights]<br>-Android 6.0 or later: Can be withdrawn from the ‘Settings &gt; Application Manager &gt; Select an app &gt; Permissions &gt; Access Permissions’ menu<br>-Under Android 6.0: It is impossible to revoke the access right, so it can be withdrawn by deleting the app			        </div>
